        "value": "Product Owner",
        "description": "A Product Owner can manage design artifacts, business requirements, user stories, user feedback, technologies, development stages, and branch templates. They can configure cloud instances and clusters, and can manage Terraform runs, Jenkins job runs, and secrets throughout the product development cycle. They can edit and delete a product and can initiate maturity assessment at the product and team level.",
