        "name": "Data Scientist",
        "value": "Data Scientist",
        "description": "A Data Scientist represents the demand-side role responsible for defining and managing MVD specifications. They define business logic, validate data suitability, establish data quality expectations, and assess whether published data assets meet analytical and business needs. Data Scientists are not involved in data asset creation. Their permissions include creating, editing, viewing, deleting, and versioning MVD specifications.",
