        "name": "Data Engineer",
        "value": "Data Engineer",
        "description": "A Data Engineer typically represents the supply-side role involved in the MVD asset creation process. They are responsible for designing, building, transforming, publishing, and maintaining data assets that support analytics, reporting, AI/ML, and semantic use cases. Data engineers also manage data asset ownership transfer, unpublishing requests, and certification or decertification of data assets.",
